</mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>12</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>16</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"CLOSE\">]</mo></mrow><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"INNER\"><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OPEN\">[</mo><mtable columnalign=\"center\" columnspacing=\"1em\" rowspacing=\"4pt\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"CLOSE\">]</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>25</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"INNER\"><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OPEN\">[</mo><mtable columnalign=\"center\" columnspacing=\"1em\" rowspacing=\"4pt\"><mtr><mtd><mn>15</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>20</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"CLOSE\">]</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"INNER\"><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OPEN\">[</mo><mtable columnalign=\"center\" columnspacing=\"1em\" rowspacing=\"4pt\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"CLOSE\">]</mo></mrow><mo>.</mo></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Since the second singular value is <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"110\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-msub><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D70E TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>, we can't use the same formula to find the second column of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"111\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D448 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>U</mi><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> But we know that <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"112\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D448 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>U</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> must be orthogonal. Hence, we must find a vector</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"113\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-msub><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D42E TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-